    "img": "icons/magic/control/energy-stream-link-white.webp",
    "name": "Sky: Ascendant (Virgo)",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♍ Virgo is ascendant today.</strong> Your Cloth is awake. For the whole day your Techniques heighten as though you were <strong>4 levels higher</strong>, and you have your Ascendant Boon.</p><p>Each time you hit with an unarmed Strike, the target must attempt a Will save against your Cosmo DC or lose a sense. Losses are cumulative: sight (blinded), hearing (deafened), smell and taste, then touch (&minus;4 to attack rolls, cannot Grapple).</p><p>Senses lost this way return only through <em>restoration</em> or a full night's rest.</p><p>Your maximum Om stacks increase to <strong>7</strong>.</p><hr /><p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Ascendant Constellation]. Applied and removed by the module's sky tracker; a GM can also drag it on by hand.</p>"
        },
